Anonymized release for peer review
==================================

This code accompanies a paper currently under double-blind review. The
copyright holder and author identities are intentionally withheld to preserve
anonymity.

For the review period, this material is provided solely for the purpose of
evaluating the submission. Redistribution outside of the review process is not
permitted.

Upon acceptance, this release will be re-licensed under a permissive open-source
license (MIT) with full attribution.
